 "title": {
  "en": "Data manipulation: INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE",
  "kn": "ದತ್ತಾಂಶ ನಿರ್ವಹಣೆ: INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "Adding, correcting and removing rows",
    "kn": "ಸಾಲುಗಳನ್ನು ಸೇರಿಸುವುದು, ತಿದ್ದುವುದು, ತೆಗೆಯುವುದು"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "New students join, marks get re-totalled, and some students leave. Three SQL commands handle all of this: INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE.",
    "kn": "ಹೊಸ ವಿದ್ಯಾರ್ಥಿಗಳು ಸೇರುತ್ತಾರೆ, ಅಂಕಗಳು ಮರುಎಣಿಕೆಯಾಗುತ್ತವೆ, ಕೆಲವರು ಬಿಡುತ್ತಾರೆ. INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE ಎಂಬ ಮೂರು SQL ಆಜ್ಞೆಗಳು ಇವನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸುತ್ತವೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Insert rows with and without a column list"
    },
    {
     "en": "Update selected rows"
    },
    {
     "en": "Delete selected rows safely"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "New students join, marks get re-totalled, and some students leave. Three SQL commands handle all of this: INSERT, UPDATE and DELETE.",
    "kn": "ಹೊಸ ವಿದ್ಯಾರ್ಥಿಗಳು ಸೇರುತ್ತಾರೆ, ಅಂಕಗಳು ಮರುಎಣಿಕೆಯಾಗುತ್ತವೆ, ಕೆಲವರು ಬಿಡುತ್ತಾರೆ. INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE ಎಂಬ ಮೂರು SQL ಆಜ್ಞೆಗಳು ಇವನ್ನೆಲ್ಲ ನಿರ್ವಹಿಸುತ್ತವೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "INSERT INTO table VALUES (...); adds a row with values in column order; INSERT INTO table (col1, col2) VALUES (...); fills only the listed columns, and the rest get NULL or their DEFAULT. UPDATE table SET col = value WHERE condition; changes matching rows. DELETE FROM table WHERE condition; removes matching rows. Without WHERE, UPDATE and DELETE affect every row, so always check the condition."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "INSERT INTO ... VALUES ..."
    },
    {
     "en": "UPDATE ... SET ... WHERE ..."
    },
    {
     "en": "DELETE FROM ... WHERE ..."
    },
    {
     "en": "No WHERE → all rows affected"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "INSERT adds rows, UPDATE changes values in rows that match a condition, and DELETE removes matching rows. Forgetting WHERE affects every row.",
    "kn": "INSERT ಸಾಲು ಸೇರಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, UPDATE ಷರತ್ತಿಗೆ ಹೊಂದುವ ಸಾಲುಗಳ ಮೌಲ್ಯ ಬದಲಿಸುತ್ತದೆ, DELETE ಅವನ್ನು ತೆಗೆಯುತ್ತದೆ. WHERE ಮರೆತರೆ ಎಲ್ಲಾ ಸಾಲುಗಳ ಮೇಲೆ ಪರಿಣಾಮ."
   }
  },
